From 9cdef7f2beb2f92f521f738f38f3131e2dc2b45b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <t@t>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 20:52:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Five rebuilt guides (cost to own, condos, rent prices, where
 to buy, Murrells Inlet) and the short-term rental figures refreshed sitewide

- /buyers/cost-to-own/, /invest/condos/, /invest/rent-prices/, /invest/where-to-buy/, /submarkets/murrells-inlet/: rebuilt from specs (batch 2026-11-a), each from a verified fact ledger, charts built from data files.
- data/str-market.json: AirROI's figures for the 12 months to September 2026 (read 2026-11-03). AirROI's revenue now includes the cleaning fees guests pay, so the change from August is not presented as market growth. Pages updated to the file: /invest/airbnb-income/ (headline: $25,800 to $42,000), /invest/rental-returns/, /buyers/second-home/, the /invest/ and /submarkets/ hubs, the homepage town cards, and the rental blocks on /submarkets/north-myrtle-beach/ and /submarkets/surfside-beach/.
- The relocating pages copy their chrome from a frozen copy of the old cost-to-own page (data/relocating/donor-cost-to-own.html); a rebuild of each is byte-identical.
- /submarkets/garden-city/: the MarshWalk's restaurants are left to the Murrells Inlet guide.
- llms.txt entries rewritten; dates and llms-full.txt rebuilt.
