+### Where are the condos?
+The county has about 41,000 condo units. About 12,000 are in North Myrtle Beach, about 12,000 in the City of Myrtle Beach, and about 17,000 outside city limits and in the smaller towns. On the ocean, towers and low-rise buildings stand side by side:
