+## How much does it cost to own a home in Myrtle Beach each year?
+Upkeep and insurance are the biggest parts. "Besides the loan" means everything except paying back the loan and its interest. Your lender usually collects the tax and insurance with each loan payment, but they are counted here, not in the loan. The HOA fee and upkeep are usually paid separately.
