 ### Is Airbnb profitable in Myrtle Beach?
 It can be, but the result usually comes down to how the unit is managed. The same $26,000-gross oceanfront condotel nets roughly $1,600 a year on a 40 percent onsite rental program and roughly $8,000 self-managed. Whole homes in North Myrtle Beach, Surfside Beach, and Murrells Inlet carry the strongest net cash flow.
 
 ### What occupancy should I expect from a Myrtle Beach Airbnb?
