 ### How much do Airbnb expenses run in Myrtle Beach?
 Plan on 55 to 65 percent of gross for a managed unit. Professional management takes 20 to 30 percent, or 35 to 45 percent on an onsite condotel desk. HOA dues on oceanfront towers are $400 to $1,200 a month. Add the 6 percent property tax assessment and short-term-rental insurance at roughly two to three times a standard homeowner policy. Platform fees come on top; for Airbnb, those are migrating to a 15.5 percent host-only fee in 2026.
